strong="H00853"\w* \w and livestock|strong="H00929"\w*.
\p \v 16 \w And|strong="H00853"\w* \w you are to gather|strong="H06908"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w its plunder|strong="H07998"\w* \w in|strong="H00413"\w* \w the middle|strong="H08432"\w* \w of the public square|strong="H07339"\w*, \w and completely burn|strong="H08313"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00784"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the city|strong="H05892"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w its plunder|strong="H07998"\w* \w as a whole burnt offering|strong="H03632"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w*. \w [The city] must remain|strong="H01961"\w* \w a mound of ruins|strong="H08510"\w* \w forever|strong="H05769"\w*, \w never|strong="H03808"\w* \w to be rebuilt|strong="H01129"\w*. \w . . .|strong="H05750"\w*
\p \v 17 \w Nothing|strong="H03808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03972"\w* \w devoted to destruction|strong="H02764"\w* \w shall cling|strong="H01692"\w* \w to your hands|strong="H03027"\w*, \w so that|strong="H04616"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w will turn|strong="H07725"\w* \w from|strong="H04480"\w* \w His fierce anger|strong="H02740"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00639"\w*, \w grant|strong="H05414"\w* you \w mercy|strong="H07356"\w*, \w show you compassion|strong="H07355"\w*, \w and multiply you|strong="H07235"\w* \w as|strong="H00834"\w* \w He swore|strong="H07650"\w* \w to your fathers|strong="H00001"\w*, \v 18 \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w you obey|strong="H08085"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06963"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w*, \w keeping|strong="H08104"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w His commandments|strong="H04687"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w I|strong="H00595"\w* \w am giving you today|strong="H06680"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03117"\w* \w [and] doing|strong="H06213"\w* \w what is right|strong="H03477"\w* \w in the eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w*.
